# Protected visual zones

Do not alter in this phase:

- `/canvas` and derivatives;
- Guide timeline and guided-story scheduler;
- internal animated preview geometry and motion;
- React Flow nodes, edges, connections, selection, zoom and viewport in interactive examples;
- internal image/document export behavior.

Allowed around protected engines:

- route/workspace header;
- canonical icon buttons, tooltips and menus;
- external sidebar shell;
- external background;
- route spacing and status states.

Treat protected engines as black boxes. Never recreate their motion or geometry while changing a wrapper.
